/P 88 0 R
/E (Following command execution activity, a Windows Security Log clearing event \(Event ID 1102\) was observed on both compromised systems. Event ID 1102 is generated when the Security log is cleared and is commonly associated with attacker attempts to remove forensic evidence and evade detection.)
